{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122100","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1012210001:0":{"text":"谢谢你们……","source_cn":"谢谢你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x903266414E493361","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012210002:0":{"text":"我诞生自塔兰河，我的责任，是保护塔兰河抚育的所有生灵。可是……我连朋友都保护不了……","source_cn":"我诞生自塔兰河，我的责任，是保护塔兰河抚育的所有生灵。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495A4C22FF9CDA9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012210003:0":{"text":"我的雨，只能延缓污染扩散，我能做到的……仅仅只有这些……我太无能了！","source_cn":"我的雨，只能延缓污染扩散，我能做到的……仅仅只有这些…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58D0CE089FAD2B3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012210004:0":{"text":"伊温，你已经很努力了，不要责怪自己。","source_cn":"伊温，你已经很努力了，不要责怪自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3BCA6654D474530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012210005:0":{"text":"塔兰村的村民们喝了被污染的水，茴姆婆婆需要用你的露珠为大家调制草药。","source_cn":"塔兰村的村民们喝了被污染的水，茴姆婆婆需要用你的露珠为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x462A1F5FDE995D12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title